source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: A brace ends the autolinked URL; Jira also lifts the `{a}` macro out of the paragraph and refuses the span, while jiro keeps the braces in the code body.
-- input.jira --
{{http://example.com{a}}
-- rendered.html --
<p>{{<a href="http://example.com" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">http://example.com</a></p>
{a}
<p>}</p>
-- want.md --
`http://example.com{a`
-- warnings.json --
[]
